// exists or not, it's up to the caller to call
// Legendre beforehand.
//
// "A note on the calculation of some functions in
// finite fields: Tricks of the Trade" by Michael Scott
// https://eprint.iacr.org/2020/1497.pdf (Sec. 6.3)
